\title{blockr.script: Script and Prose Blocks for 'blockr'}
\description{
A block for 'blockr' boards whose state is an ordinary R script. The script reads any number of upstream results and returns whatever its last statement evaluates to. A top-level assignment of a plain value becomes a control on the block, and the exported code is the script with the current values written in. A prose block holds markdown with inline R, as 'Quarto' writes it, and reads its inputs the same way.
